# (AI-assisted) j2vis: the task-toggled background prototypes at new-game task state (c3l v20).
# ctypal-tomb: the statue wall (shown) and the rubble (hidden until canyon-insert-items-shard);
# strip-start: strip-pipe-01 / vents (hidden until strip-grenade); sewer-start: sewer-hover-door
# (hidden). Shots after each stop's stance; the [ctr] "the game hides" lines name what is hidden.
1000 continue ctypal-tomb
1001 -
1002 wait *target* target-stance
1003 log stop: ctypal-tomb
1004 pos *target*
1300 shot vis_ctypal
1400 continue strip-start
1401 -
1402 wait *target* target-stance
1403 log stop: strip-start
1404 pos *target*
1700 shot vis_strip
1800 continue sewer-start
1801 -
1802 wait *target* target-stance
1803 log stop: sewer-start
1804 pos *target*
2100 shot vis_sewer
2200 exit
